WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.674 --> 00:00:06.234
Today's 1 Minute Monday is "Purpose".

00:00:06.234 --> 00:00:09.283
Have a purpose! What are you doing this for?

00:00:09.283 --> 00:00:12.880
If you're starting the business just trying to make money you're never going to make it.

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:16.147
It's not going to work. You're going to quit as soon as it gets hard.

00:00:16.147 --> 00:00:18.186
You have to have a purpose!

00:00:18.186 --> 00:00:21.022
If you look at the most successful, most famous entrepreneurs in the world,

00:00:21.022 --> 00:00:23.091
they started their business for a reason.

00:00:23.091 --> 00:00:27.042
They started their business to have an impact somewhere, to give back,

00:00:27.042 --> 00:00:30.262
to make meaningful change. They have a purpose!

00:00:30.262 --> 00:00:34.440
Until you discover what your purpose is and start living it,

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:37.414
you're never going to have success as an entrepreneur.

00:00:37.414 --> 00:00:40.081
Focus on you purpose!

00:00:40.081 --> 00:00:41.552
Believe!

00:00:41.552 --> 00:00:44.133
For those of you who watched and liked the video, thumbs up below.

00:00:44.133 --> 00:00:46.631
Let me know what you think, leave a comment, if you have a question

00:00:46.631 --> 00:00:48.419
I'll make a video response for you.

00:00:48.419 --> 00:00:50.041
Thank you so much and I'll see you soon!

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.000
